  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math> be any complex number such that <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is a purely imaginary number, then,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "any non-zero real number other than <math><mn>1</mn></math> .",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "a purely imaginary number.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "any non-zero real number",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is a purely imaginary number<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> is a purely imaginary<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> is purely imaginary<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; (from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> won&rsquo;t be an imaginary number)<br />&nbsp;"
